<title>BRAZIL: Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the week ended October 20 compared with the previous week and the corresponding week last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>    Week ended   Week ended   Week ended</p>
<p> .	  20/10/96     13/10/96     22/10/95</p>
<p> Bean	  nil	   35,300	  nil</p>
<p> Meal	248,600	167,000	237,900</p>
<p> Oil	  15,800	 14,000	  nil</p>
<p>The following are shipments so far in the 1996/97 February-January marketing year compared with the corresponding date in the previous year, in tonnes -</p>
<p> .	  1996/97	 1995/96</p>
<p> Bean   3,492,500     3,759,200</p>
<p> Meal   8,717,200     8,556,300</p>
<p> Oil    1,076,300     1,248,100</p>
<p>Note - Shipment this marketing year includes 386,300 tonnes of Paraguayan origin. Previous marketing year includes 564,400 tonnes of Paraguayan origin.</p>
</text>
